  "title": "​Stop Toddler Bedtime Battles: Pediatrician-Approved Sleep Routine (Ages 1-3)",
  "summary": "We know how exhausting toddler sleep challenges are. If you're struggling with bedtime battles or frequent wake-ups, you're in the majority—this affects up to 50% of young children. Establishing a consistent and predictable toddler sleep routine is foundational for your child’s development, supporting their cognitive growth, memory, and emotional regulation.",
